{"book":"dn20","suttas":[{"id":"dn20","title":"","rows":[["dn20:0.1","Dīgha Nikāya 20","","",""],["dn20:0.2","Mahāsamayasutta","7. mahāsamayasuttaṃ","7. Mahāsamayasuttaṃ","mahāsamayasuttaṃ"],["dn20:1.1","Evaṁ me sutaṁ—","evaṃ me sutaṃ:","Evaṃ me sutaṃ –","evamme sutaṃ."],["dn20:1.2","ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi;","ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṃ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṃ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi.","ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṃ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṃ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi;","ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṃ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṃ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi."],["dn20:1.3","dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca."],["dn20:2.1","Atha kho catunnaṁ suddhāvāsakāyikānaṁ devatānaṁ etadahosi:","atha kho catunnaṃ suddhāvāsakāyikānaṃ devatānaṃ etadahosi:","Atha kho catunnaṃ suddhāvāsakāyikānaṃ devatānaṃ etadahosi –","athakho catunnaṃ suddhāvāsakāyikānaṃ devānaṃ etadahosi"],["dn20:2.2","“ayaṁ kho bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi;","“ayaṃ kho bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṃ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṃ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi.","‘‘ayaṃ kho bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṃ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṃ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi;","ayaṃ kho bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṃ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṃ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi"],["dn20:2.3","dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca,","dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca"],["dn20:2.4","Yannūna mayampi yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkameyyāma; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato santike paccekaṁ gāthaṁ bhāseyyāmā”ti.","yannūna mayampi yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkameyyāma. upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato santike paccekaṃ gāthaṃ bhāseyyāmā”ti.","Yaṃnūna mayampi yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkameyyāma; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato santike paccekaṃ gāthaṃ bhāseyyāmā’’ti.","yannūna mayampi yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkameyyāma upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato santike paccekagāthaṃ bhāseyyāmāti."],["dn20:3.1","Atha kho tā devatā seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṁ vā bāhaṁ pasāreyya pasāritaṁ vā bāhaṁ samiñjeyya; evameva—suddhāvāsesu devesu antarahitā bhagavato purato pāturahesuṁ.","atha kho tā devatā seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṃ vā bāhaṃ pasāreyya, pasāritaṃ vā bāhaṃ samiñjeyya, evameva suddhāvāsesu devesu antarahitā bhagavato purato pāturahesuṃ.","Atha kho tā devatā seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṃ vā bāhaṃ pasāreyya pasāritaṃ vā bāhaṃ samiñjeyya, evameva suddhāvāsesu devesu antarahitā bhagavato purato pāturahesuṃ.","athakho tā devatā seyyathāpi nāma balavā puraso sammiñjitaṃ vā bāhaṃ pasāreyya pasāritaṃ vā bāhaṃ sammiñjeyya evameva suddhāvāsesu devesu antarahitā bhagavato purato pāturahaṃsu."],["dn20:3.2","Atha kho tā devatā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ aṭṭhaṁsu.","atha kho tā devatā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ aṭṭhaṃsu.","Atha kho tā devatā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ aṭṭhaṃsu.","athakho tā devatā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ aṭṭhaṃsu."],["dn20:3.3","Ekamantaṁ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi:","ekamantaṃ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi:","Ekamantaṃ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi –","ekamantaṃ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi"],["dn20:3.4","“Mahāsamayo pavanasmiṁ,","“mahāsamayo pavanasmiṃ","‘‘Mahāsamayo pavanasmiṃ,","mahāsamayo pavanasmiṃ"],["dn20:3.5","Devakāyā samāgatā;","devakāyā samāgatā,","devakāyā samāgatā;","devakāyā samāgatā"],["dn20:3.6","Āgatamha imaṁ dhammasamayaṁ,","āgatamha imaṃ dhammasamayaṃ","Āgatamha imaṃ dhammasamayaṃ,","āgatamha imaṃ dhammasamayaṃ"],["dn20:3.7","Dakkhitāye aparājitasaṅghan”ti.","dakkhitāye aparājitasaṅghanti.”","dakkhitāye aparājitasaṅgha’’nti.","dakkhitāyeva aparājitasaṅghanti."],["dn20:3.8","Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi:","atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi:","Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi –","athakho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi"],["dn20:3.9","“Tatra bhikkhavo samādahaṁsu,","“tatra bhikkhavo samādahaṃsu","‘‘Tatra bhikkhavo samādahaṃsu,","tatra bhikkhavo samādahaṃsu"],["dn20:3.10","Cittamattano ujukaṁ akaṁsu;","cittamattano ujukamakaṃsu,","cittamattano ujukaṃ akaṃsu ;","cittaṃ attano ujukamakaṃsu"],["dn20:3.11","Sārathīva nettāni gahetvā,","sārathīva nettāni gahetvā","Sārathīva nettāni gahetvā,","sārathīva nettāni gahetvā"],["dn20:3.12","Indriyāni rakkhanti paṇḍitā”ti.","indriyāni rakkhanti paṇḍitā”ti.","indriyāni rakkhanti paṇḍitā’’ti.","indriyāni rakkhanti paṇḍitāti."],["dn20:3.13","Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi:","atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi:","Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi –","athakho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi"],["dn20:3.14","“Chetvā khīlaṁ chetvā palighaṁ,","“chetvā khīlaṃ chetvā palighaṃ","‘‘Chetvā khīlaṃ chetvā palighaṃ,","chetvā khīlaṃ chetvā palīghaṃ"],["dn20:3.15","Indakhīlaṁ ūhacca manejā;","indakhīlaṃ ūhacca manejā,","indakhīlaṃ ūhacca manejā;","indakhīlaṃ ohaccamanejā"],["dn20:3.16","Te caranti suddhā vimalā,","te caranti suddhā vimalā","Te caranti suddhā vimalā,","te caranti suddhā vimalā"],["dn20:3.17","Cakkhumatā sudantā susunāgā”ti.","cakkhumatā sudantā susu nāgā’ti.","cakkhumatā sudantā susunāgā’’ti.","cakkhumatā sudantā susūnāgāti."],["dn20:3.18","Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi:","atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi:","Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi –","athakho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi"],["dn20:3.19","“Ye keci buddhaṁ saraṇaṁ gatāse,","“ye keci buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gatāse","‘‘Yekeci buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gatāse,","ye keci buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gatāse"],["dn20:3.20","Na te gamissanti apāyabhūmiṁ;","na te gamissanti apāyabhūmiṃ","na te gamissanti apāyabhūmiṃ;","na te gamissanti apāyabhūmiṃ"],["dn20:3.21","Pahāya mānusaṁ dehaṁ,","pahāya mānusaṃ dehaṃ","Pahāya mānusaṃ dehaṃ,","pahāya mānusaṃ dehaṃ"],["dn20:3.22","Devakāyaṁ paripūressantī”ti.","devakāyaṃ paripūressantī’ti.","devakāyaṃ paripūressantī’’ti.","devakāyaṃ paripūressantīti."],["dn20:4.0","1. Devatāsannipāta","","","athakho"],["dn20:4.1","Atha kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi:","atha kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi,","Devatāsannipātā Atha kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi –","bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi"],["dn20:4.2","“yebhuyyena, bhikkhave, dasasu lokadhātūsu devatā sannipatitā honti, tathāgataṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","“yebhuyyena bhikkhave, dasasu lokadhātūsu devatā sannipatitā honti, tathāgataṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca,","‘‘yebhuyyena, bhikkhave, dasasu lokadhātūsu devatā sannipatitā honti , tathāgataṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca.","yebhuyyena bhikkhave dasasu lokadhātūsu devatā sannipatitā honti tathāgataṃ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca"],["dn20:4.3","Yepi te, bhikkhave, ahesuṁ atītamaddhānaṁ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṁ etapparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā ahesuṁ seyyathāpi mayhaṁ etarahi.","ye pi te bhikkhave ahesuṃ, atītamaddhānaṃ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṃ etaṃparamā yeva devatā sannipatitā ahesuṃ seyyathāpi mayhaṃ etarahi.","Yepi te, bhikkhave, ahesuṃ atītamaddhānaṃ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṃ etaṃparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā ahesuṃ seyyathāpi mayhaṃ etarahi.","yepi te bhikkhave ahesuṃ atītamaddhānaṃ arahanto sammāsambuddhā tesampi bhagavantānaṃ etaparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā ahesuṃ seyyathāpi mayhaṃ etarahi"],["dn20:4.4","Yepi te, bhikkhave, bhavissanti anāgatamaddhānaṁ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṁ etapparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā bhavissanti seyyathāpi mayhaṁ etarahi.","ye pi te bhikkhave, bhavissantianāgatamaddhānaṃarahantosammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṃ etaṃparamā yeva devatā sannipatitā bhavissanti seyyathāpi mayhaṃ etarahi.","Yepi te, bhikkhave, bhavissanti anāgatamaddhānaṃ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṃ etaṃparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā bhavissanti seyyathāpi mayhaṃ etarahi.","yepi te bhikkhave bhavissanti anāgatamaddhānaṃ arahanto sammāsambuddhā tesampi bhagavantānaṃ etaparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā bhavissanti seyyathāpi mayhaṃ etarahi"],["dn20:4.5","Ācikkhissāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni;","ācikkhissāmi bhikkhave devakāyānaṃ nāmāni,","Ācikkhissāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṃ nāmāni;","ācikkhissāmi bhikkhave devakāyānaṃ nāmāni"],["dn20:4.6","kittayissāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni;","kittayissāmi bhikkhave devakāyānaṃ nāmāni,","kittayissāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṃ nāmāni;","kittayissāmi bhikkhave devakāyānaṃ nāmāni"],["dn20:4.7","desessāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni.","desissāmi bhikkhave devakāyānaṃ nāmāni.","desessāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṃ nāmāni.","desissāmi bhikkhave devakāyānaṃ nāmāni"],["dn20:4.8","Taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasikarotha, bhāsissāmī”ti.","taṃ suṇātha sādhukaṃ manasi karotha bhāsissāmī”ti.","Taṃ suṇātha, sādhukaṃ manasikarotha, bhāsissāmī’’ti.","taṃ suṇātha sādhukaṃ manasika